<title>UK: VUB sets 1.5 bln Slovak crown 2-yr bond.</title>
<headline>VUB sets 1.5 bln Slovak crown 2-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bankers Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VSEOBECNA UVEROVA BANKA AS</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN SKK   COUPON     12.40 PCT MATURITY    09.DEC 98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING  BRATISLAVA  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/SK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     SLOVAK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
